# Admin chevron down (accordions & selects)

Use the shared **brand blue** chevron (`#024768`) for every dropdown indicator in the admin UI.

## `<select>` fields

All single-value selects under `.admin-body` get a custom chevron automatically via `admin.css`. No extra markup needed.

Do not rely on the browser default arrow. If a select is outside `.admin-body`, add class `admin-select` and mirror the same rules.

## Accordions (`<details>` / `<summary>`)

**Option A — CSS triangle on summary** (time entries pattern):

```html
<details class="cp-time-entry">
  <summary class="cp-time-entry__summary">...</summary>
</details>
```

Uses `::after` on `.cp-time-entry__summary` (already styled).

**Option B — Font Awesome chevron** (quotation accordion pattern):

```html
<summary>
  <span class="admin-chevron-down" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa fa-chevron-down"></i></span>
  ...
</summary>
```

**Option C — Generic summary class:**

Add `admin-chevron-summary` to `<summary>` for the triangle `::after` chevron (centered, rotates when open).

## Rules

- Chevron points **down** when closed, **rotates 180°** when open.
- Always **vertically centered** (`align-self: center` on the chevron / `::after`).
- Color: `var(--admin-chevron-color)` / `--admin-primary`.
- Size tokens: `--admin-chevron-size`, `--admin-chevron-width` in `admin.css`.
